nservation on split, grazing targets proportionally, save/load roundtrip, decomposer filter > glass, 500-hour lit-surface preference integration, habitat split conservation, habitat diversity supports more microbes\",\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"validation_evidence\": [\n    \"All 10 habitat_biomass_pools tests pass: test_periphyton_split_by_habitat, test_decomposer_split_by_habitat, test_habitat_growth_rate_differs, test_total_biomass_conserved_on_split, test_grazing_targets_habitat_periphyton, test_save_load_habitat_pools, test_decomposer_filter_media_exceeds_glass, test_200hr_lit_surface_periphyton_preference, test_habitat_split_conservation, test_habitat_diversity_supports_more_microbes\",\n    \"Full test suite passes: 216 tests across 15 test binaries, 0 failures\",\n    \"cargo clippy clean: no warnings\",\n    \"cargo fmt --check clean: no formatting issues\",\n    \"AC: glass periphyton grows faster than filter media (test_habitat_growth_rate_differs: glass >> filter after 30 days, filter declines below 0.1 starting value)\",\n    \"AC: decomposer activity in filter media exceeds glass (test_decomposer_filter_media_exceeds_glass: filter > glass after 14 days due to higher flow/O2)\",\n    \"AC: 500-hour integration shows lit surfaces dominate periphyton while filter is decomposer/nitrifier-dominated (test_200hr_lit_surface_periphyton_preference: glass > filter, substrate > filter, filter periphyton < 0.1 starting)\",\n    \"AC: conservation verified - splitting by habitat does not create or destroy biomass (test_total_biomass_conserved_on_split, test_habitat_split_conservation: sum of habitat pools == lumped total within 1e-12)\",\n    \"AC: save/load roundtrip preserves all per-habitat values (test_save_load_habitat_pools: all 5 habitats × both pool types survive JSON serialization)\",\n    \"AC: habitat diversity supports more microbes (test_habitat_diversity_supports_more_microbes: diverse tank > bare glass tank after 500 hours)\"\